<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>XJ.safePdfa(html, selector)</b></font></td><td>安全 pdfa（异常返回空数组）</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>XJ.safePdfh(html, selector)</b></font></td><td>安全 pdfh（异常返回空字符串）</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>XJ.safePd(html, selector, host)</b></font></td><td>安全 pd（异常返回空字符串）</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>XJ.isDirectVideo(url)</b></font></td><td>检测是否为直链视频</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>XJ.randomColor()</b></font></td><td>生成随机颜色</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>XJ.playWithFeedback(cardId, tempTitle, originalTitle, delay)</b></font></td><td>播放点击反馈：临时更新标题→定时恢复</td></tr>
